; audit C3: a `(pass …)` written outside `(pass-graph …)` — the trap the
; site's pass.md documents. The hook is registered on the graph, so a root
; `(pass …)` never lowered; the document validated, compiled to a payload with
; NO bytecode, and `pngine inspect` panicked on it. Expected: a located
; diagnostic on the pass naming `(pass-graph …)`.
(pass :name main :code """
@fragment fn fs(@builtin(position) p: vec4f) -> @location(0) vec4f {
  return vec4f(p.xy / 512.0, 0.5, 1.0);
}
""")
